title: Sustaining Open Projects with the It Takes a Village Framework
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson as:
  Dennis, T. (2025). Sustaining Open Projects with the It Takes a Village Framework.
  Adapted from the It Takes a Village (ITAV) guide by LYRASIS.
  Available under a CC-BY 4.0 License.
authors:
  - given-names: Tim
    family-names: Dennis
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6632-3812
abstract: >-
  An introductory decision workshop for contributors to open projects in libraries,
  research, and open scholarship. Learners use a fictional case to connect community
  needs, governance rules, infrastructure, and resource limits in a proposal for
  consultation. ITAV supplies the organizing framework; selected UC OSPO Sustainability
  Playbook chapters provide academic context. The proposed timing and teaching design
  require a learner pilot.
